WEBVTT

1
00:00:08,720 --> 00:00:10,720
Could this be Ji Chuan's girlfriend?

2
00:00:10,720 --> 00:00:12,640
She goes out every day

3
00:00:12,640 --> 00:00:14,340
Just to find her

4
00:00:14,340 --> 00:00:18,330
Not to mention the big sister style

5
00:00:18,330 --> 00:00:20,130
It seems that Ji Chuan was with her during his lifetime.

6
00:00:20,130 --> 00:00:23,300
Both of them sympathized with Sou Sou Sou.

7
00:00:23,300 --> 00:00:33,390
Sister-in-law Hao Zimao

8
00:00:33,390 --> 00:00:38,860
I thought you two were a couple, right?

9
00:00:38,860 --> 00:00:40,030
I am Lin Lulu

10
00:00:40,030 --> 00:00:41,830
I was rescued twice by brother Ji Chuan today

11
00:00:41,830 --> 00:00:43,530
What do I call you, sister?

12
00:00:43,530 --> 00:00:44,630
I am Gu Yunxi

13
00:00:44,630 --> 00:00:46,830
It's thanks to him that he's Ji Chuan's neighbor.

14
00:00:46,830 --> 00:00:48,430
I didn't starve my neighbor to death

15
00:00:48,430 --> 00:00:50,330
Why didn't brother Jichuan go back to live with him?

16
00:00:50,330 --> 00:00:52,130
Is it right to be with you?

17
00:00:52,130 --> 00:00:53,130
His home is down there

18
00:00:53,130 --> 00:00:54,330
Better than here

19
00:00:54,330 --> 00:00:56,130
Why doesn't he go back to live there?

20
00:00:56,130 --> 00:00:58,130
Does he really have a crush on me?
